{"id": "msg_d7f7c356b13e4f93b37b9628f9123b70", "role": "user", "parts": [{"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call-446ae341-eaef-4e0c-813f-5bdcbd67370f-174__fc_edf47632-12e2-95d5-9836-15f5732506a6_0", "tool_name": "read", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "completed", "tool_output": "[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"<path>D:\\\\WorkBuddy\\\\金瓶梅翻译\\\\translation\\\\output\\\\ch060_seg02.md</path>\\n<type>file</type>\\n<content>\\n48: 　　惊损了六叶相连的肝肺，\\n49: 　　吓坏了三毛七孔的心。\\n50: \\n51: （原文：惊损六叶连肝肺，唬坏三毛七孔心。）\\n52: \\n53: 连月娘都慌得两步并作一步，径直扑到房中。见孩子抽得两只眼直往上吊，全不见黑眼珠儿，口里流出白沫，咿咿地像小鸡叫，手脚都动。一见之下，心中犹如刀割，连忙把他搂抱起来，脸贴着他的嘴儿，大哭道：“我的哥哥，我出去时还好好的，怎么就抽起来了？”\\n\\n(Showing lines 48-53 of 73. Use offset=54 to continue.)\\n</content>\"}]", "tool_output_group_id": "msg_d7f7c356b13e4f93b37b9628f9123b70", "tool_output_group_original_chars": 398, "tool_output_group_budget_chars": 100000}], "created_at": "2026-11-03T02:55:02.702Z"}
{"id": "msg_151414c14a564b658c8189841c87f18a", "role": "assistant", "parts": [{"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call-6c337881-e215-43de-9ace-302748316bb1-175__fc_f5cee950-39d7-93ed-bfcf-6459bc3e968d_0", "tool_name": "edit", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "running", "tool_input": {"file_path": "D:\\WorkBuddy\\金瓶梅翻译\\translation\\output\\ch060_seg02.md", "old_string": "\n（原文：春点桃花红绽蕊，风欺杨柳绿翻腰。）", "new_string": ""}}, {"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call-6c337881-e215-43de-9ace-302748316bb1-176__fc_f5cee950-39d7-93ed-bfcf-6459bc3e968d_1", "tool_name": "edit", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "running", "tool_input": {"file_path": "D:\\WorkBuddy\\金瓶梅翻译\\translation\\output\\ch060_seg02.md", "old_string": "\n（原文：惊损六叶连肝肺，唬坏三毛七孔心。）", "new_string": ""}}, {"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call-6c337881-e215-43de-9ace-302748316bb1-177__fc_f5cee950-39d7-93ed-bfcf-6459bc3e968d_2", "tool_name": "edit", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "running", "tool_input": {"file_path": "D:\\WorkBuddy\\金瓶梅翻译\\translation\\output\\ch060_seg01.md", "old_string": "\n（原文：若非道子观音画，定然延寿美人图。）", "new_string": ""}}, {"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call-6c337881-e215-43de-9ace-302748316bb1-178__fc_f5cee950-39d7-93ed-bfcf-6459bc3e968d_3", "tool_name": "edit", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "running", "tool_input": {"file_path": "D:\\WorkBuddy\\金瓶梅翻译\\translation\\output\\ch060_seg00.md", "old_string": "\n（原文：枫叶初丹槲叶黄，河阳愁髩恰新霜。鬼门徒忆空回首，泉路凭谁说断肠？路杳云迷愁漠漠，珠沉玉殒事茫茫。惟有泪珠能结雨，尽倾东海恨无疆。）", "new_string": ""}}, {"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call-6c337881-e215-43de-9ace-302748316bb1-179__fc_f5cee950-39d7-93ed-bfcf-6459bc3e968d_4", "tool_name": "edit", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "running", "tool_input": {"file_path": "D:\\WorkBuddy\\金瓶梅翻译\\translation\\output\\ch060_seg00.md", "old_string": "\n（原文：天仙机上整香罗，入手先拖雪一窝。不独桃源能问渡，却来月窟伴嫦娥。）", "new_string": ""}}, {"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call-6c337881-e215-43de-9ace-302748316bb1-180__fc_f5cee950-39d7-93ed-bfcf-6459bc3e968d_5", "tool_name": "edit", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "running", "tool_input": {"file_path": "D:\\WorkBuddy\\金瓶梅翻译\\translation\\output\\ch060_seg03.md", "old_string": "\n（原文：不在阳间擒鼠耗，却归阴府作狸仙。）", "new_string": ""}}], "created_at": "2026-11-03T02:55:17.457Z"}
